      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        GPS en vivo
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"/><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"/></svg>
        Rodadas organizadas
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="3 6 9 3 15 6 21 3 21 18 15 21 9 18 3 21"/><line x1="9" x2="15" y1="3" y2="6"/><line x1="9" x2="9" y1="18" y2="21"/></svg>
        Rutas con waypoints
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        Puntos de apoyo
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
        Ficha médica ICE
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5c0-2 2-3 4-3.5Z"/></svg>
        Modo offline
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        Multi-club
      </div>
      <!-- Duplicated for seamless loop -->
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
        SOS de emergencia
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        GPS en vivo
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"/><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"/></svg>
        Rodadas organizadas
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="3 6 9 3 15 6 21 3 21 18 15 21 9 18 3 21"/><line x1="9" x2="15" y1="3" y2="6"/><line x1="9" x2="9" y1="18" y2="21"/></svg>
        Rutas con waypoints
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        Puntos de apoyo
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
        Ficha médica ICE
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5c0-2 2-3 4-3.5Z"/></svg>
        Modo offline
      </div>
      <div class="marquee-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        Multi-club
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STATS SECTION -->
  <section class="stats">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card reveal">
          <div class="stat-value" data-count="300">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Rodadas organizadas</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="stat-value" data-count="64200" data-suffix="+">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Km recorridos</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="stat-value" data-count="100" data-suffix="%">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Alertas SOS atendidas</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="stat-value" data-count="21" data-suffix=" días">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">De prueba gratis</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROBLEM / SOLUTION SECTION -->
  <section class="problem" id="problema">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <div class="section-label">El problema</div>
        <h2>¿Tu club sigue rodando en el caos?</h2>
        <p>Los grupos de WhatsApp, las hojas de Excel y las llamadas desesperadas no son una herramienta de gestión. Son una fuente de estrés para los líderes y un riesgo para la seguridad de la manada.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-layout">
        <div class="problem-col chaos reveal">
          <h3>Así se organiza hoy</h3>
          <div class="problem-card">
            <div class="problem-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M17 18a5 5 0 0 0-10 0"/>
                <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="9" y2="2"/>
                <line x1="4.22" x2="5.64" y1="10.22" y2="11.64"/>
                <line x1="1" x2="3" y1="18" y2="18"/>
                <line x1="21" x2="23" y1="18" y2="18"/>
                <line x1="18.36" x2="19.78" y1="11.64" y2="10.22"/>
                <line x1="23" x2="1" y1="22" y2="22"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Mensajes perdidos en WhatsApp</h4>
              <p>El punto de encuentro cambió 5 veces, pero solo 3 pilotos se enteraron. El resto llegó tarde o a otro lugar.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-card">
            <div class="problem-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>"¿Dónde estás?" en cada rodada</h4>
              <p>Se pierden pilotos, no sabes quién va al frente y quién hace barredora. La comunicación se desintegra.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-card">
            <div class="problem-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"/>
                <path d="M12 9v4"/>
                <path d="M12 17h.01"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Emergencias sin protocolo</h4>
              <p>Un pinchazo, un accidente o un piloto descompuesto: nadie sabe quién está cerca, qué tipo de sangre es ni a quién llamar.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-arrow reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"/>
